# The Roborazzi baseline shipped in the initial commit was corrupt: byte 0x89 of the PNG signature
# had been re-encoded as UTF-8 and its CRLF collapsed to LF, so ImageIO could not read it back and
# every screenshot comparison failed. Mark binaries explicitly so no line-ending or encoding pass
# can touch them again.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary

# Keep the wrapper script LF so it stays executable on the Linux CI runner.
gradlew text eol=lf
